flowchart TB
  U[User] -->|Question + Personas| API[Backend API]
  API -->|Build Graph Inputs| ORCH[Orchestrator Node]

  subgraph LG[LangGraph StateGraph]
    ORCH -->|Dispatch R1| R1P[Round 1 Personas - parallel]
    R1P --> AGG1[Round 1 Aggregate]
    AGG1 -->|Low confidence or missing info| ASK[Ask User for Context]
    ASK --> ORCH
    AGG1 -->|Needs debate| R2P[Round 2 Personas - parallel]
    R2P --> AGG2[Round 2 Aggregate]
    AGG2 --> FINAL[Final Synthesis + Scoring]
  end

  subgraph LC[LangChain Agents]
    ORCH --> OC[Orchestrator Chain]
    R1P --> PC[Persona Chains]
    R2P --> PC
  end

  subgraph TOOLS[Tools]
    CONS[Consensus Scorer]
    RISK[Risk Scorer]
    EVID[Evidence Extractor]
  end

  ORCH --> CONS
  ORCH --> RISK
  ORCH --> EVID

  subgraph STATE[Graph State]
    S[(State Store)]
  end

  ORCH --- S
  R1P --- S
  AGG1 --- S
  R2P --- S
  AGG2 --- S
  FINAL --- S

  FINAL --> API --> UI[Frontend Results]
